  "instance_name": "steak_recipe_meme_concept",
  "label": "Steak Recipe Meme Concept",
  "description": "The meme uses the absurd and grotesque juxtaposition of a 'recipe' (a set of instructions for preparing food) with the violent act of slaughtering an animal. This concept relies on the viewer's understanding of culinary culture and the common perception of steak as a desirable food item, which is then contrasted with the violent reality of its production. The humor derives from the shock value and the dark irony of equating destruction with preparation.",
